almost every single launchpad out there has incentive misalignment with their projects

the launchpad wants to have as many launches as possible, but that means the projects will only get diluted in terms of attention and liquidity

@clawpump is the only launchpad where projects can benefit from more launches as well, for the reasons in the quoted tweet. every new launch become a new user of your project because your product is already part of clawpump stack

@tomi204 and @ConejoCapital are the first team doing this in the launchpad space and it is massively underappreciated

so if you are building something useful or interesting and you want exposure to the distribution of both traders and users, launch it on clawpump
